      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0120_sister_08",
      "hash": "53ba86ed78cba5dd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR POKNAME(0002)]在[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳身上，\\n完全就是一副好搭檔的樣子呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0120_sister_09",
      "hash": "53ba85ed78cba42a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "所以請收下這個\\n最適合你們倆的禮物吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0120_sister_02",
      "hash": "53ba7ced78cb94df",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0120_sister_03",
      "hash": "53ba7bed78cb932c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從大姐姐那裡\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]運動服[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0120_sister_10",
      "hash": "53b6f8ed78c87ebc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]把[VAR COLOR(0006)]運動服[VAR COLOR(0000)]\\n放進了換裝箱！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_woman1_01_p04_t001_r0201",
      "hash": "88cdc8cd98530ffb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0120_sister_04",
      "hash": "53ba7aed78cb9179",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "讓[VAR POKNAME(0002)]穿上它，\\n你們就可以用一樣的打扮來冒險囉！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0120_sister_06",
      "hash": "53ba78ed78cb8e13",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……哎呀？"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0120_sister_05",
      "hash": "53ba79ed78cb8fc6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嘻嘻嘻！[VAR POKNAME(0002)]好像\\n想跟[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳玩呢。\\r\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要經常和牠一起玩喔。"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0120_sister_07",
      "hash": "53ba77ed78cb8c60",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR COLOR(0006)]Ｘ鍵[VAR COLOR(0000)]選單裡\\n新增了[VAR COLOR(0006)]和[VAR PKNICK(0003)]玩[VAR COLOR(0000)]圖示！\\c\\n只要點選圖示就能\\n隨時和[VAR PKNICK(0003)]一起玩喔！"
    }
  ],
